silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_07_worked_household_to_vetclinic_sections_01_surface_household_csv_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'SurfaceHouseholdCsvYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the row-level transport. the transport functor F preserves this typed leg in the Mittens vet-clinic migration; the household-side arrow is named and the clinic-side image is named, with arrow direction and typing kept intact." .
